---
import quoteMark from '../../assets/figma/quote.svg';
import Pli from '../ui/Pli.astro';
---

<section class="moments container" aria-labelledby="moments-title">
  <figure class="moments__quote">
    <img src={quoteMark.src} width="91" height="97" alt="" />
    <blockquote class="t-display-m">
      <p>While you plan the big day, don't forget to look at the person beside you."</p>
    </blockquote>
  </figure>

  <div class="moments__body">
    <h2 id="moments-title" class="moments__heading t-heading-l">
      <span>Small moments, <em>big difference</em></span>
    </h2>
    <div class="moments__text t-body-l">
      <p>
        Love rarely lives in the big gestures. It lives in a glance across the table, a question at
        the end of a long day, the moment one of you says "look at this" and the other really looks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Psychologists call these moments bids. In a six-year study of newlyweds, <strong
          >the couples who stayed together turned toward each other's bids 86% of the time.</strong
        >
        The couples who later divorced, 33%. <em
          >(<a
            href="https://www.gottman.com/blog/turn-toward-instead-of-away/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            data-ph-event="source_link_clicked"
            data-ph-source="gottman">The Gottman Institute</a
          >)</em
        >
      </p>
      <p class="moments__close">
        Relationships aren't found. They're built, one small moment at a time. <Pli /> gives you a few
        of those moments, to keep.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="moments__next t-heading-l t-muted"><span>Your story, <em>kept</em></span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .moments {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 432fr) minmax(0, 684fr);
    column-gap: calc(124 / 1240 * 100%);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .moments__quote {
    position: relative;
  }
  .moments__quote img {
    width: clamp(56px, 6.33vw, 91px);
    height: auto;
  }
  .moments__quote blockquote {
    margin-top: -9px;
    line-height: 68px;
  }

  .moments__heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
  .moments__heading::before,
  .moments__next::before {
    content: '';
    flex: none;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .moments__next {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
  .moments__next::before {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .moments__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
  }
  .moments__text strong {
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  }
  .moments__text a {
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .moments__close {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  }

  @media (max-width: 959px) {
    .moments {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      row-gap: var(--space-8);
    }
    .moments__quote blockquote {
      line-height: var(--leading-display-m);
    }
    .moments__text {
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
